The incident took place in a large evangelical church of Lakewood, where Pastor Joel Auxin is preached, promising that devout Christians are waiting for wretrifugality and prosperity.
In November 2021 plumber Justin Cowley remanded one of the church toilets and found thousands of packages with money and cheque insulation under thermal insulation.
