The money was inassured, so the church did not suffer losses.
Nevertheless for the information about the criminals announced an award, amounting to 25 thousand dollars.
Justin Cowley couldn’t apply for this amount, because the award had already expired.
Despite this, the not-for-commercial organization Crime Stoppers of Houston, at one time allocating five thousand dollars for the award and later received another 20 thousand dollars a donation from Lakewood, decided to reward the honesty of plumber.
It will receive 20 thousand dollars.
