$135 Billion Gone to Appendix - Hi-Tech
In the year of 2021, the cost of users in applications increased by 25% worldwide, and the number of downloads by 8%.
The most popular in the world turned out to be various video services.
Most of all, users downloaded the CapCut video rare, and spent the most on YouTube.
And the number of downloads of applications, and the costs of users in them showed a significant growth in the period from January to November 2021.
the number of downloads increased by 8%, reaching 140 billion. Even significantly increased the spending of users in applications: by 25%, to a record $ 135 billion.
Such data was published by the analytic company App Annie, which presented a report on the market of mobile applications in 2021.
In 2021, the world economy came out of the lockdown and began post-pandemic recovery.
“Whether such a “return to the physical” growth of the economy of the applications will persuasure it,” the authors of the report said.
The leader in the number of download applications was India: it accounted for about 20% of all downloads.
It is supported by the United States (9 per cent) and Brazil (8%).
Users of gadgets on iOS, as before, spent more than users with an Android: iOS accounted for 65% of all costs in applications.
Among the applications of the first place in the number of downloads for the year in 2021 was taken by video educator CapCut.
It is followed by two Indian applications: MX TakaTak video service and an online trading app Meesho.
In the top 10 according to the number of downloads also includes Telegram.
In general, judging by the number of downloads, among the users, VPN services are popular (there are in the top 10 two - VPN Master and NightOwl VPN) and services associated with creating and broadcasting videos (similar CapCut and MX TakaTaak, two more such services - Moj and SnackVideo).
“Most of all, users spent in applications for live broadcasts and online streaming”, – the authors of the report note.
YouTube is in the lead here, in the top 5 in terms of user expenses also includes TikTok video services, distribution video services of Disney + and HBO Max, as well as the Japanese subscription service to the manga Piccoma.
The first place in the number of monthly active users is occupied by Telegram, Instagram, Zoom and TikTok, the top 5 mobile version of the Microsoft Office.
In Russia the leader in the number of downloads for the year turned out to be a shopping application AliExpress.
It is followed by Zenly service, which shows the location of his friends, and still the same CapCut.
Also in the top 10 of applications include: online karaok StarMaker, online retailer of Shein clothes, application Maps for Minecraft PE, an online taxi service DiDi, a client for YouTube Pure Tuber, retailer application "Dixie" and an online store "Samokat".
Around the world, people have adapted to the pandemics through the transition to life in a bicycle, which can be called one of the main conclusions.
The greatest success was achieved by those industries that helped people to be closer both virtually and in person, ”commented Lexey Sidou, Head of Marketing Research at App Annie.
Revenue of the mobile gaming sector in 2021 reached $ 90 billion. The leaders in the number of downloads were casual and hyper-casature games in which there is not or almost no plot, and the video presentation is minimal.
In the top 3 most popular games in the world included Count Masters, Project Makeover and Bridge Race.
DOP 2: Delete One Party, Going Balls and Phone Case DIY.
Earlier, App Annie presented its forecast for the year 2022.
Among the main trends of next-yield, analysts of the company called the increase in the number of TikTok users to $ 1.5 billion, an increase in the growth of the Z generation of financial applications, such as applications for Robinhood investors, as well as a further increase increase in the popularity of metaversive mobile games.
