Doctor Pavelova told about the “migraine of the day off” from workaholics
To a deterioration in well-feel health at the weekend can lead to several factors
The reason for the deterioration of well-feeling after everyday life is often the “migraine of the weekend”, said the well-known endocrinologist, candidate of medical Sciences, a senior researcher of the faculty of fundamental medicine of Moscow State University, the scientific director of the Clinic of Systems Medicine Zukhra Pavlova in his telegram channel.
According to her, especially often suffer from workaholics, who have a headache at the weekend, weakness and weakness.
Doctor Pavlova noted that in addition to the accumulated frosty for a week there are quite a lot of objective reasons for the negative reaction of the body to a change in conditions.
On weekends, our life changes radically.
“Live for a long time, all day we lie on the couch, most likely we ate more, and we drank less,” the doctor reasoned. – Due to the lack of coffee begins a slight withdrawal.
Due to overeating and a lack of water - heaviness and frustration."
An additional role is played by Late Ascending.
So, if you stand for three hours later than usual, then there will be a reaction, which is called a jet lamp.
It arises from travelers who cross several time zones.
To determine which of the factors plays a decisive role in the deterioration of well-being, Pavlova recommended trampling what changes the most on the weekend.
