Scientists of the South Africa announced the low efficacy of the Pfizer vaccine against “omicron”
In South-Apriquertination said about the low efficiency Pfizer vaccine against “omicron”
Scholars of the Republic of South Africa carried out a study and reported a low efficacy of Pfizer vaccine against the omicron strain of coronavirus infection.
According to estimates, it (the level of neutralization "omicron") corresponds (the level) of the vaccine efficacy of 22.5% against infection with symptoms, because of which ... the ability of the vaccine to protect against infection is questioned, - the text of the study said, according to a study published on the portal MedRxiv.
At the same time, experts said that the drug can save from the severe course of the disease.
Earlier in the London Hygiene and Tropical Medicine School predicted that the omicron strain of the coronavirus can cause a new wave of a pandemic in the UK with more frequent hospitalization than a year ago.
How Much Hidden Suggreap in Accompanies?
Sugar isn't the best source of beneficial nutrient.
Its excess in the diet can lead to diabetes of the second type, as well as cause cardiovascular and oncological diseases.
Users should take into account the fact that under an unfamiliar word, hidden sugar can be indicated - an ingredient similar to calorie sugar, composition and glycemic indic.
On the platter can be presented a few dozen names, in fact, denoting sugar.
One of the most common and most common names are glucose and fructose.
There may also be other dug sugars, such as dextrose (sugar obtained from corn), levulosis (fruit sugar), melasas (black molasses), syrup agave, etc.
These are simple carbohydrates, which belong to mono and disaccharides, and they can be not only in confectionery products, but also in ketchup, doctoral sausages, bread, etc.
As stated in Roskachestvo, the most effective way to reduce sugar intake is to use whole and unprocessed products, as well as pay attention to the label and the many different names of sugar.
Different types of sugar are dilibrated, but no matter what the ingredient in the composition of the product - syrup or nektar, processed or unprocessed, brown or white - it still remains sugar.
To calculate the exact amount of sugar is not easy, since it is necessary to take into account not only the amount of sugar indicated by the manufacturer on the package, but also the fact that vegetables, fruits, etc. initially contain a certain amount of sugar.
Thus, the total amount of sugar can be significantly higher than indicated on the label.
German Chancellor Scholz: the gas will lose the importance for Germany in 25 years
The new German chancellor Olaf Scholz said that gas imports are losing importance for Germany, since the country continues the transition to decarbonization of the economy.
According to him, according to him, by 2045 plans to completely abandon gas, oil and coal, becoming a climatic neutral country.
“That is, in 25 years the world will be such that the issue of transporting gas to Germany and Europe will play a different role”, – said the chancellor.
Scholz noted that Germany continues to remain committed to ensuring that Ukraine transports Russian natural gas in the future, since at the moment this resource is of great importance for an energy transition.
He reminded that Germany and the United States made a statement, in which Berlin’s energy transformation support from Ukraine.
Earlier, German foreign Minister Annalena Berbock said that the process of certifying the Nord Stream 2 gas pipeline is ongoing.
According to the Minister, within the framework of coalition negotiations and the discussion of the coalition agreement, it was stated that energy projects should be applied European law in the field of energy.
The diplomat also pointed out that the pipeline has not yet complied with the regulations of the European Union.
