In Turkey tested the world's first drone with laser weapons
In Turkey were successfully tested the world's first drone with a laser weapon.
UAV "Eren" was tested at a distance from 100 to 500 m, according to "MIR24".
the device is able at a distance to neutralize explosive objects with the help of a laser.
The maximum height of the flight of the novelty reaches 3 thousand meters.
