Experts warned about the threat of a cancer due to vitamin B9
Studies show an excess of vitamin B9, also known as folic-accustomic acid, can lead to cancer.
About it was warned by the Daily Express.
According to experts, there is compelling strong evidence that people who do not experience a lack of faudice is less at the risk of falling ill with certain types of cancer, in particular, colorectal.
However, the excess of the required dose on the contrary contributes to the growth of carcinous cells.
Professor at Alabama University in Birmingham, nutritionist Beth Kitchin advises to monitor the amount of folic acid consumed during the day.
The optimal dose is 400 micrograms per day.
Threat of cancer rises only in the event, if you significantly deviate from this figure in a greater or lesser way.
Kitchin recommends not to take vitamin B9 in pills without a doctor's recommendation, be sure to monitor the dosage and avoid ceremonies with milk and other foods that contain folic meal.
Earlier nutrition consultant Rachel Fein called folic acid a substance that slows the aggregation.
Since it, among other things is contained in avocado, Fein recommended that men after the age of 50 are more likely to eat this fetus.
In the U.K. by the time of April because of the omicron-stroke can die about 75 thousand people
Forecasts of British scientists show that due to the spread of the omicron strain of the coronavirus in the next five months in the next five months in England can die up to 75 thousand people, if you do not tighten the restrictive measures in the winter.
This was reported by the newspaper The Guardian, citing a study of experts of the London Institute of Hygiene and Tropical Medicine (LSHTM), reports TASS.
According to the most optimistic forecast of specialists who are part of the scientific-consulting group on emergency situations at the British Cabinet of Ministers, by April of 2022, at least 25 thousand deaths will be recorded in the country due to an Omicron strain of omicrone, and about 175 thousand patients will be hospitalized.
In this case, more than 2 thousand infected will be taken at the peak of the velocities of the hospital every day.
“Serious measures to combat the coronavirus may be necessary to prevent congestion of the National health service if the omicron strain is more contagious than a variant of the delta, and existing vaccines will not be able to exclude infections,” said mathematician Rozanna Barnard of LSTM.
Earlier, the Agency for health security of the United Kingdom reported that if the rate of distribution of the omicron strain remains at the current level, then by the end of the year about 1 million cases of infection will be detected in the country.
At the same time by mid-December, the Omicron strain can become dominant in the United Kingdom.
At the present moment in the UK found 1898 cases of infection with the omicron strain of the coronavirus, of which 633 were detected in the last 24 hours.
At the same time, on December 29, the head of the British Ministry of Health, Sajid Javid, pointed out that in reality this figure may already reach 10 thousand cases.
