This is the lowest figure since he was elected head of state.
Analyst analysts predicted a situation in which, in the case in the event of the next presidential elections of Ukraine for Zelensky would give their vote of only 21.8%, while for the ex-president of the country Petro Poroshenko - 14.5%.
At the same time, among all those interviewees, only 19.3% expressed support for the president.
