Metaunivers will change the Russian business
The topic of the meta-univers became popular in the autumn of this year, when Mark Zuckerberg announced the transformation of Facebook into Meta.
For the market, this event became an important signal: the largest player confirmed the development of a new format of digital interaction between people.
This means that business in Russia, as well as around all over the world, will be invested in the creation of their own meta-universes and their subsequent monetization.
Meta-univers should be considered as a sequel as a continuation of objectively existing trends.
On the one hand, the tendency to create remote interactions in conditions of a pandemic, because people are tired of dividing and restrictions.
On the other - this is a consequence of the desire of business to develop ecosystems and to adapt operating models to them.
From the third - they are a meticulous continuation of the trend of digitalization of assets, when any rights, securities, works of art and even money turn into a digital format.
